#
# Yosys synthesis of vga_text_engine to the IHP Open PDK SG13G2 130 nm standard cell
# library. Produces real silicon area in square micrometres and a real cell histogram, a
# gate level netlist for static timing analysis and gate level simulation, and a JSON
# netlist for schematic rendering.
#
# This is a template. scripts/synth_sg13g2.py substitutes the placeholders and writes the
# result next to the reports, so any run can be reproduced by hand from the generated
# script. Placeholders:
#
#   @LIB@      Liberty file for the corner being characterised
#   @CORNER@   short corner name, used in the output file names
#   @OUT@      output directory
#   @FLATTEN@  "-flatten" for the signoff run, empty for the per submodule area run
#   @TAG@      "flat" or "hier", used in the output file names
#
# The driver runs this twice per corner. The hierarchical run keeps module boundaries so
# stat can report an area per submodule; the flattened run is the signoff netlist, where
# cross boundary optimisation has been allowed. Mapping has to start from the RTL each
# time: running abc a second time over cells it has already mapped produces a netlist
# with undriven outputs.
#
# check runs here for the record but does not assert. After flatten, Yosys keeps both the
# port wire and the flattened alias of it, opt_clean drops the alias, and check then
# reports the alias as an undriven wire even though the port is driven by a cell. Reading
# the written netlist back and checking that proves the point: the artifact that leaves
# this script is clean. scripts/synth_sg13g2.py does exactly that, and gate level
# simulation of a whole frame against the reference renderer is the real proof.
#
# SYNTHESIS is defined so the elaboration time parameter checks, which use simulation
# only system tasks, are excluded.

read_verilog -sv -DSYNTHESIS \
    rtl/vte_modes_pkg.sv \
    rtl/vte_pkg.sv \
    rtl/vte_mode_lut.sv \
    rtl/vte_sync2.sv \
    rtl/vte_cdc_fifo.sv \
    rtl/vte_frame_sync.sv \
    rtl/vte_timing_gen.sv \
    rtl/vte_glyph_rom.sv \
    rtl/vte_shader.sv \
    rtl/vte_fetch_engine.sv \
    rtl/vte_axil_regs.sv \
    rtl/vga_text_engine.sv

hierarchy -check -top vga_text_engine

synth -top vga_text_engine @FLATTEN@
dfflibmap -liberty @LIB@
abc -liberty @LIB@
opt_clean

tee -o @OUT@/area_@TAG@_@CORNER@.txt stat -liberty @LIB@
tee -o @OUT@/check_@TAG@_@CORNER@.txt check

write_json @OUT@/netlist_@TAG@_@CORNER@.json
write_verilog -noattr @OUT@/netlist_@TAG@_@CORNER@.v
